      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Asphalt is a sticky, black, and highly viscous liquid or semi-solid form of petroleum. It is used primarily for road construction, where it is mixed with aggregate particles to create asphalt concrete. Its processing level includes refinement from crude oil, and it is subject to quality and compliance standards for construction materials. Asphalt usage spans from road paving to waterproofing applications. It is generally available as a production mix at an asphalt plant, and as a component in construction mixes to the consumer.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "沥青是一种粘稠、黑色、高粘度的液态或半固态石油产品。主要用于道路建设，与骨料混合后制成沥青混凝土。其加工水平包括从原油中精炼，并且它要符合建筑材料的质量和合规标准。沥青的使用范围从铺路到防水应用都有。它通常作为生产混合物在沥青厂可得，以及作为建筑混合材料的组成部分提供给消费者。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
